{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel, etc.</b> This teaches that they would give birth to six in one womb. And a hint from the fact that the vav of ישראל is plene — for the language of 'be fruitful and multiply': פרו וישרצו וירבו ויעצמו במאד מאד. Another explanation: כי פרו וישרצו has a gematria of six in one womb less two, and likewise במאד מאד completes the calculation. Another explanation: פרו — that they produce fruits; וישרצו — like creeping things, six in one womb. And if you ask that they would die — therefore it says וירבו. And if you ask that they were weak — therefore it says ויעצמו במאד מאד. And therefore all these extra expressions are written."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:29.160902358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}